  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-134353",
  "summary": "rclone before 1.76.0 Credential Leak via Swift, NetStorage and Seafile Redirects",
  "details": "rclone before 1.76.0 leaks credentials in its swift, netstorage and seafile backends, which follow HTTP redirects using Go's default policy: swift and netstorage send auth headers or passwords on cross-host or HTTPS-to-HTTP redirects, and seafile sends API tokens or passwords on same-host HTTPS-to-HTTP redirects. Attackers receiving or observing a redirect issued by the configured endpoint can capture these credentials to access storage or replay signed requests.",
